            "content": "<h3>Perth:</h3><p>Shop 7, Ground Floor,<br/>386 Wanneroo Road Westminster WA 6061<br/></p><h3>Como:</h3><p>Collier Park Golf Club<br/>Hayman Road<br/>Como, WA 6152</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_aUKp3U": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why Use Us",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "content": "<ul><li>We provide lifetime technical support after the course</li><li>We have conducted training for over 25,000 satisfied students across WA with over 2500+ positive reviews</li><li>Our Nationally Recognised Course is fully accredited</li><li>We are a certified  Registered Training Organisation</li><li>Our WA instructors are test and tag industry professionals </li><li>Course is delivered in an easy-to-understand and interactive manner</li><li>The most comprehensive test and tag course available </li><li>Special deals after the course if you would like to buy equipment or accessories</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_PLAMRG": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Portable Appliance Testers (PAT's)",
            "icon": "lightning_bolt",
            "content": "<p>Test and Tag Training will teach you how to use the latest and most popular Portable Appliance Testers on the Australian market.<br/><br/>For students looking to buy a new PAT, this will give you the opportunity to try a few different options and to choose the ideal one for your job. We stock a complete range of PAT Testers for you to try out of our Perth Head Office.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
