    "custom_liquid_kQTReH": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "disabled": true,
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"page-width  page-width--narrow\">\n<h3>Our Training process will guarantee you're supported every step of the way</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0861/8482/1048/files/test-tag-training-process.jpg?v=1706048389\" alt=\"Face-to-face Tests &amp Tag Course Process\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\n<p>There are two types of courses for getting your test and tag license in WA and both certify you as a 'competent person'. By Australian standards, this confirms you're capable of testing electrical appliances.</p>\n<p>If you are unsure of the difference between two courses, we can help you <a href=\"/pages/choosing-right-course\">choosing the right course</a>.</p>\n\n</div>",
        "color_scheme": "",
        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 36
      }
    },
